[style name="New_File"]
[background arg="res://assets/background/Background_02_Pointer_F7_05_02_00_.png" fade="0.0"]
join jono left [animation="Slide From Left"]
jono: Geez... Who dose that mage think he is anyway!?
jono: I gotta admit, though... that guy was real tough...
jono: Hey, Prince, How about a game until that guy comes back?
[clear time="1.0" portraits="false" music="false" background="false" positions="false" style="false" node=""]
- <Duel>
	set {Dialogue} = "res://Resources/timelines/dueling_grounds/ground_duels_lost.dtl"
	set {Label} = "JonoLost"
	set {DeckIndex} = 3.0
	jump IniciarDuelo/StartDuel
- <Pass>
	jono: 'Fraid of starting off on the wrong foot, eh? I can understand that.
	jono: Let's wait for thee mage.
	jono: Y'know, the guy's real tough...
	jono: Listen, I play here day in and day out. And you know I'm pretty good...
	jono: Fact is, there ain't too many duelists I can't beat.
	jono: But that mage... Man...! He's good!
	jono: I didn't have a chance!
	jono: Listen, Prince... Don't underestimate the guy.
	jono: I know you're good. But don't get sloppy...
label SetoBack
if {Story.DuelSeto1} == true:
	leave jono [animation="Slide To Left" wait="true"]
	[background arg="res://assets/background-story/SetoDG.png" fade="0.5"]
	jono: There he is... He's back.
	jono: Do me a favor and whip the guy.
	teana: Do it, Prince!
	[background arg="#000000ff" fade="0.4" wait="true"]
	[background arg="res://assets/background/Background_02_Pointer_F7_05_02_00_.png" fade="0.0"]
	join seto left [animation="Slide From Left" wait="true"]
	\seto: I do not know how good you are... But I hope you will entertain me.
	\seto: I will have you know that I enjoy a good game...
	\seto: Do not disappoint me!
	set {DeckIndex} = 7.0
	set {Dialogue} = "res://Resources/timelines/dueling_grounds/ground_duels_lost.dtl"
	set {Label} = "SetoLost"
	jump IniciarDuelo/StartDuel
label JonoHappy
join jono left [animation="Slide From Left"]
jono: Didja see the look on his face!? You were grreat!!!
teana: Prince... You're just too good!
jono: "I bid you farewell"... Hah! what a loser!
jono: Prince, Well, what now?
jono: You still got some time?
- <Go outside>
set {ActiveScene} = 1.0
[end_timeline]